  "translation": "Ol i tok, wanwan man long kwan bilong en: Em i no stret, olsem na mipela i wokim ⟨hia⟩. Dispela de em i de bilong gutpela toksave, tasol mipela i stil tingting. Sapos mipela wet inap lait bilong moning i kam, rong bilong mipela bai painim mipela. Na nau, yu ol go, yumi go insait, yumi go skelim long haus bilong king.",
